From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <address-in-upstream-commit@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:42:01 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 38/93] arm64: dts: apple: t6050: share the G17S GPU
 description

t6050-k114c-gpu.dtsi and t6050-k116s-gpu.dtsi describe the GPU in the same
G17S layout: the gpu alias, six loader-filled reservations, the GFX and GFX1
mailboxes in place of the inventory ASC nodes, the always-on GPX and AFR
states and the sgx override. Only one property differs per board (K114c
keeps GFX on across s2idle, K116s puts the GPU on its PMP report entry).

Move the common part into t6050-gpu-g17s.dtsi so other M5 Pro boards can use
it. Both boards keep their own notes and their one board property. The K116s
ADT reference values move to the file header unchanged.

No functional change: the K114c and K116s DTBs are byte-identical before and
after.

Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <address-in-upstream-commit@localhost>
---
