 .../arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-k114c-gpu.dtsi | 107 +----------
 .../arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-k116s-gpu.dtsi | 169 ++++--------------
 3 files changed, 161 insertions(+), 242 deletions(-)
